{"version":1,"content":"<p>「小薯茄」的程人富、肥蚊、阿J，聯同王嘉盈﹑體壇健將「蜘蛛女」鄭麗莎（Lisa），昨天（15日）出席《那一年，打轉教室》記者會，宣布2026年12月25日至2027年1月10日，在西九文化區自由空間演出15場。</p><p>發布會上導演鄧樹榮親自示範如何訓練肢體形態，包括單腳企及走路姿勢。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:40:40.357679+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:50:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T08:57:33.779199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:38:13.880331+00:00","content_hash":"f9cbb3836b870e53b22212b8ff9527c8a7e0e9361033cda062d8be6320561aab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}